###
### INSURANCE API — Colección completa de requests
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@contentType = application/json

### ── Variables (llenar tras crear recursos) ──
@customerId = {{create_customer.response.body.id}}
@policyId   = {{create_policy_auto.response.body.id}}


###
### 1. CUSTOMERS
###

### 1.1 Crear cliente ✅ → 201
# @name create_customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Juan Pérez",
  "email": "juan.perez@email.com"
}

###

### 1.2 Crear segundo cliente (para pruebas LOYALTY)
# @name create_customer_loyalty
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "María López",
  "email": "maria.lopez@email.com"
}

###

### 1.3 Obtener cliente por ID ✅ → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.4 Email duplicado ✅ → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Otro Juan",
  "email": "juan.perez@email.com"
}

###

### 1.5 Cliente inexistente ✅ → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


###
### 2. CREAR PÓLIZAS — 4 ramos x 3 estrategias
###

### ── RAMO AUTO

### 2.1 AUTO + STANDARD ✅ → 201 | premium: 120.000
# @name create_policy_auto
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "branch": "AUTO",
  "ratingStrategy": "STANDARD"
}

###

### 2.2 AUTO + RISK_BASED (riskScore=50) ✅ → 201 | premium: 180.000
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "branch": "AUTO",
  "ratingStrategy": "RISK_BASED",
  "riskScore": 50
}

###

### 2.3 AUTO + LOYALTY (customerSince=2020) ✅ → 201 | premium: 102.000
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "branch": "AUTO",
  "ratingStrategy": "LOYALTY",
  "customerSince": 2020
}

###

