###
### 3. CONSULTAS DE PÓLIZAS
###

### 3.1 Obtener póliza por ID ✅ → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 3.2 Póliza inexistente ✅ → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/policies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 3.3 Todas las pólizas del cliente ✅ → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/policies/customer/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


###
### 4. CICLO DE VIDA COMPLETO
### QUOTED→ISSUED→ACTIVE→SUSPENDED→ACTIVE→CANCELLED
###

### 4.1 QUOTED → ISSUED ✅ → 200 | evento: policy.issued
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetStatus": "ISSUED"
}

###

### 4.2 ISSUED → ACTIVE ✅ → 200 | evento: policy.activated
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetStatus": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### 4.3 ACTIVE → SUSPENDED ✅ → 200 | evento: policy.suspended
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetStatus": "SUSPENDED"
}

###

### 4.4 SUSPENDED → ACTIVE ✅ → 200 | evento: policy.reactivated
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetStatus": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### 4.5 ACTIVE → CANCELLED ✅ → 200 | evento: policy.cancelled
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetStatus": "CANCELLED"
}

###


###
### 5. CASOS DE ERROR — requeridos por la rúbrica
###

### 5.1 Transición inválida desde CANCELLED ✅ → 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetStatus": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### 5.2 Salto inválido QUOTED → ACTIVE ✅ → 400
### (crear nueva póliza primero y usar su ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/policies/{{policyId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "targetStatus": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### 5.3 RISK_BASED sin riskScore ✅ → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "branch": "AUTO",
  "ratingStrategy": "RISK_BASED"
}

###

### 5.4 RISK_BASED con riskScore fuera de rango ✅ → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "branch": "HOME",
  "ratingStrategy": "RISK_BASED",
  "riskScore": 150
}

###

### 5.5 LOYALTY sin customerSince ✅ → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "branch": "LIFE",
  "ratingStrategy": "LOYALTY"
}

###

### 5.6 LOYALTY con antigüedad menor a 2 años ✅ → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "branch": "LIFE",
  "ratingStrategy": "LOYALTY",
  "customerSince": 2025
}

###

### 5.7 Ramo inválido ✅ → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "branch": "INVALID_BRANCH",
  "ratingStrategy": "STANDARD"
}

###

### 5.8 Cliente inexistente al crear póliza ✅ → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "branch": "AUTO",
  "ratingStrategy": "STANDARD"
}

###

### 5.9 DTO vacío ✅ → 400 con detalle por campo
POST {{baseUrl}}/policies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}